    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Deadlike - the unkillable nightmare, and the TIA's worst mistake. Trapped in a facility that wants your regeneration powers, you must slice, shoot, and explode your way through waves of enemies and finally put an end to Chronos, the boss of this military company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Juicy Combat</strong> \u2013 Tear through enemies with <strong>dual katanas and desert eagles</strong>, chaining attacks into devastating <strong>gore finishers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/deea2d23ec9c6a4dd0adc57dbefd652b.poster.avif?t=1748529649\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/deea2d23ec9c6a4dd0adc57dbefd652b.webm?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/deea2d23ec9c6a4dd0adc57dbefd652b.mp4?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Brutal Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against TIA\u2019s deadliest soldiers and experimental creations in intense, high-stakes battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/698d40e24430e3f094c260481acf2182.poster.avif?t=1748529649\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/698d40e24430e3f094c260481acf2182.webm?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/698d40e24430e3f094c260481acf2182.mp4?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Gore-Filled Finishers</strong> \u2013 End fights in the most <i>creative</i> ways possible. Rip, slice, and blast your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/4eccdb844d6f18fece133b8e30d3b599.poster.avif?t=1748529649\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/4eccdb844d6f18fece133b8e30d3b599.webm?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/4eccdb844d6f18fece133b8e30d3b599.mp4?t=1748529649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Roguelike Madness</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same! <strong>Randomized levels</strong> inside a massive military complex keep you on your toes.<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Upgrades &amp; Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock <strong>new skills, upgrades, and abilities</strong> to get stronger with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong> Because it\u2019s fast, bloody, and completely insane. Because every run makes you stronger. Because Deadlike adapts and comes back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and get ready to slice, shoot, and respawn like a pro!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351790/extras/9dbf44ee027acc2f40199cbd3d708453.avif?t=1748529649\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
